# 🚤 ESP32-S3 RC Boat

A lightweight DIY RC boat built using an **ESP32-S3**, a **720 coreless DC motor**, a **3.7V Li-Po battery**, and a **custom-made motor driver**.

The boat uses a **31 mm 3-blade propeller** for propulsion. The motor driver is designed from individual electronic components, including an **AO3400 MOSFET, SS14 Schottky diode, 10kΩ resistor, and capacitor**.

![ESP32-S3 RC Boat](images/boat.jpg)

---

## 🔧 Components

| Component | Specification |
|---|---|
| Microcontroller | ESP32-S3 |
| Motor | 720 Coreless DC Motor |
| Battery | 3.7V Li-Po |
| Motor Driver | Self-Made |
| MOSFET | AO3400 |
| Diode | SS14 Schottky Diode |
| Resistor | 10kΩ |
| Capacitor | Connected at ESP32-S3 power input |
| Propeller | 31 mm, 3-Blade |

---

## ⚡ Custom Motor Driver

The motor driver was **designed and built from scratch** instead of using a ready-made motor driver module.

The **AO3400 MOSFET** is used as the main switching device to control the 720 coreless motor.

The **SS14 Schottky diode** provides protection against voltage spikes and back-EMF generated by the motor.

A **10kΩ resistor** is used for MOSFET gate control.

A **capacitor is connected at the ESP32-S3 power input** to help stabilize the supply voltage and reduce disturbances caused by changes in motor current.

---

## 🔋 Power

The boat is powered by a **3.7V Li-Po battery**.

The battery provides power to the ESP32-S3 and the motor driver, which controls the 720 coreless motor.

---

## 🚤 Propulsion

The propulsion system consists of a **720 coreless DC motor** connected to a **31 mm 3-blade propeller**.

When the ESP32-S3 activates the MOSFET, current flows through the motor, causing it to rotate the propeller and generate thrust.

---

## 🧠 Working Principle

```text
       3.7V Li-Po Battery
              │
              ├──────────────► ESP32-S3
              │                    │
              │                    │ Control Signal
              │                    ▼
              │              AO3400 MOSFET
              │                    │
              │                    ▼
              └────────────► 720 Coreless Motor
                                   │
                                   ▼
                           31mm 3-Blade
                             Propeller
                                   │
                                   ▼
                                Thrust
                                   │
                                   ▼
                              🚤 Boat

